x\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">Ideal Workplace Award</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin:3px 0 8px\">8,412 people viewed · Home </div>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"border-radius:12px;width:100%\">Collection</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"background:var(--bg-soft);border-radius:16px;padding:12px 14px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text)\">Bean</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">3 minutes ago · Parent-child paradise</div>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"demo-tag green\" style=\"border-radius:999px\">Lv.6</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border-radius:16px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">I finished building an entire dinosaur castle today, which feels so fulfilling! </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"border-radius:999px\">👍 Praise him</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"border-radius:999px\">Play together</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"corner-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sharp\"><span class=\"corner-anat-s\" style=\"border-radius:0\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"subtle\"><span class=\"corner-anat-s\" style=\"border-radius:6px\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"friendly\"><span class=\"corner-anat-s\" style=\"border-radius:12px\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"pill\"><span class=\"corner-anat-s\" style=\"width:56px;border-radius:999px\"></span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"corner-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sharp\"><span class=\"corner-anat-s\" style=\"border-radius:0\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"subtle\"><span class=\"corner-anat-s\" style=\"border-radius:6px\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"friendly\"><span class=\"corner-anat-s\" style=\"border-radius:12px\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"pill\"><span class=\"corner-anat-s\" style=\"width:56px;border-radius:999px\"></span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"sharp","cn":"直角","en":"Sharp","desc":"半径为 0；可与边框、字重和间距共同形成更硬朗的轮廓","desc_en":"Radius is 0; works with border, weight, and spacing to create a stronger outline"},{"key":"subtle","cn":"小圆角","en":"Subtle","desc":"相对组件尺寸较小的半径，适合需要保留边缘感的界面元素","desc_en":"A smaller radius relative to component size, suitable for interface elements that need to retain a sense of edge"},{"key":"friendly","cn":"中圆角","en":"Medium","desc":"半径占尺寸的比例更高；和组件比例、间距一起检查","desc_en":"Radius is a higher proportion of size; check with component proportions and spacing"},{"key":"pill","cn":"胶囊","en":"Pill","desc":"半径至少接近高度的一半，形成两端圆弧的形状","desc_en":"The radius is at least close to half the height, forming the shape of arcs at both ends"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"直角","en":"Sharp","demo":"<span class=\"corner-v\" style=\"border-radius:0\"></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"corner-v\" style=\"border-radius:0\"></span>","when":"需要清楚边缘或与既有直角系统保持一致时","when_en":"When edges need to be clear or consistent with an existing right angle system"},{"cn":"较小圆角","en":"Subtle","demo":"<span class=\"corner-v\" style=\"border-radius:6px\"></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"corner-v\" style=\"border-radius:6px\"></span>","when":"需要保留边缘感，同时略微柔化轮廓时","when_en":"When you need to preserve the edge while slightly softening the outline"},{"cn":"较大圆角","en":"Rounded","demo":"<span class=\"corner-v\" style=\"border-radius:12px\"></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"corner-v\" style=\"border-radius:12px\"></span>","when":"组件尺寸允许更明显圆弧，且与系统其他角色协调时","when_en":"Component size allows for more pronounced arcs when coordinated with other roles in the system"},{"cn":"胶囊","en":"Pill","demo":"<span class=\"corner-v\" style=\"width:64px;border-radius:999px\"></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"corner-v\" style=\"width:64px;border-radius:999px\"></span>","when":"长条标签或按钮需要两端完整圆弧时","when_en":"When long labels or buttons require complete arcs at both ends"}],"use":[{"t":"先按<b>组件角色建立圆角档位</b>：卡片、输入框、按钮可不同，但相同角色保持一致","m":"corner-subtle"},{"t":"用<b>尺寸比例</b>检查圆角：小组件的大圆角会显得更强，胶囊通常适合高度较小的标签或按钮","m":"corner-pill"},{"t":"在真实页面中<b>对照边框、阴影和密度</b>：圆角的感受来自组合，不由某个数值或行业决定","m":"corner-friendly"}],"dont":[{"t":"同类元素的<b>圆角规则不一致</b>：相同角色看起来像来自不同系统","m":"corner-mess","bad":true},{"t":"某个控件的<b>轮廓与页面系统差异过大</b>：应结合品牌、任务风险和其他控件一起评估","m":"corner-mismatch","bad":true},{"t":"所有层级<b>使用相同显著圆角</b>：卡片、输入框与按钮的角色可能不易区分","m":"corner-overdose","bad":true},{"t":"<b>随意增加圆角数值</b>：没有对应组件角色或 token，后续难以维护","m":"corner-random","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"全站卡片有的接近直角、有的像胶囊，按钮和输入框也各用不同数值。怎样统一“圆角气质”？","options":[{"id":"role-based-corner-system","label":"按卡片、输入和操作等角色建立少量档位，同类组件保持一致","feedback":"圆角感受来自整套角色关系，少量规则能形成一致气质，也保留必要层级。","correct":true},{"id":"maximum-rounding","label":"把所有元素统一成最大圆角，确保整个网站都显得柔和","feedback":"同一显著圆角会抹平组件角色，长方形内容还可能变成不合适的胶囊或椭圆。","correct":false},{"id":"visual-one-offs","label":"保留现状，遇到不协调的组件就单独微调一个新数值","feedback":"逐项修补会继续扩大规则数量，下一次新增组件仍无法知道该使用哪个档位。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"Some cards are nearly square and others pill-like, while buttons and inputs each use different values. How can the site's corner feel become coherent?","options":[{"id":"role-based-corner-system","label":"Create a small set of role-based levels for cards, inputs, and actions and keep peers consistent","feedback":"Corner feel emerges from role relationships, so a small system creates coherence while retaining necessary hierarchy.","correct":true},{"id":"maximum-rounding","label":"Apply maximum rounding to every element so the whole site feels soft","feedback":"One strong radius erases component roles and may turn rectangular content into inappropriate pills or ellipses.","correct":false},{"id":"visual-one-offs","label":"Keep the current system and introduce a new value whenever one component feels wrong","feedback":"One-off fixes continue expanding the rule set and leave future components without a clear choice.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请先按组件角色盘点圆角，再定义少量 small、medium、large 或等价 token。相同角色必须复用，胶囊只给明确的小型操作或标签；在真实卡片、输入框和按钮组合中比较整体气质。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Audit radii by component role, then define a small set of equivalent small, medium, and large tokens. Require reuse within roles, reserve pills for explicit compact actions or tags, and compare the system in real card, input, and button combinations."}},"references":[{"title":"border-radius 属性","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/border-radius","title_en":"border-radius"}],"scenes":["金融与工程工具","企业 SaaS 界面","消费级 App","儿童与社交产品"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Define a product-wide corner scale","m":"corner-subtle"},{"t":"Differentiate compact controls from large surfaces","m":"corner-pill"},{"t":"Support a precise or approachable tone","m":"corner-friendly"}],"dont":[{"t":"Mix sharp, round, and pill shapes without a reason","m":"corner-mess","bad":true},{"t":"Use the same large radius on every box","m":"corner-mismatch","bad":true},{"t":"Let nested rounded corners collide","m":"corner-overdose","bad":true},{"t":"Use corner shape as a substitute for information hierarchy","m":"corner-random","bad":true}],"scenes":["Design system","Buttons and inputs","Cards and dialogs","Tags and pills"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:0;padding:12px 14px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1;color:var(--text)\">Review of large transfer</b>\n        <span 